# Land Equilibrium: an opponent who controls at least as many lands as its controller puts a land onto the battlefield, then
# sacrifices a land of their choice - the land just played among them (the rulings), so it is on the battlefield before the
# sacrifice (CR 614.6). Bot2 plays a land on turns 2 and 4 with fewer lands than Bot1 (0 to 1, 1 to 2) and keeps it; Bot1's
# own land play on turn 3 is no opponent's; on turn 6 Bot2 has exactly as many (2 to 2), plays a Mountain and sacrifices
# that Mountain. The Ornithopter Bot2 casts then is no land, and nothing is sacrificed for it.
[Bot1 Deck]
Land Equilibrium
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Forest
Mountain
Ornithopter
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp x10

